---
source: src/cli/mod.rs
surface: memory_hook_boundary
assertion: ee does not expose or generate a zsh command-interception hook
contracts:
  - ee hook preflight-shell --shell zsh is rejected as an unknown command
  - ee hook --help does not advertise preflight-shell
  - no public library generator emits a zsh preexec hook
  - ee preflight check remains an explicit advisory memory query
evidence:
  - tests/preflight_hook_zsh.rs::zsh_preflight_shell_interceptor_is_not_a_public_command
  - tests/preflight_hook_zsh.rs::hook_help_does_not_advertise_a_shell_interceptor
